sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant PO as Product Owner
  participant SM as Scrum Master
  participant DEV as Developers
  participant STK as Stakeholders

  PO->>PO: Maintain Product Backlog
  PO->>PO: Refine & Prioritize Items

  SM->>PO: Facilitate Sprint Planning
  SM->>DEV: Facilitate Sprint Planning
  PO-->>DEV: Present Goals & Prioritized Items
  DEV->>DEV: Estimate & Select Items
  DEV->>DEV: Create Sprint Backlog

  loop Daily Scrum (Each Day)
    SM->>DEV: Facilitate Daily Scrum
    DEV->>DEV: Plan Daily Work & Identify Impediments
    SM->>SM: Remove Impediments
  end

  par Implementation & Quality
    DEV->>DEV: Implement User Stories
    DEV->>DEV: Unit & Integration Testing
    DEV->>DEV: Code Review
  and Definition of Done
    DEV->>DEV: Verify Definition of Done
  end

  DEV->>SM: Demo Increment
  SM->>STK: Facilitate Sprint Review
  STK-->>PO: Provide Feedback
  PO->>PO: Update Product Backlog

  SM->>DEV: Facilitate Retrospective
  DEV->>DEV: Identify Improvements
  SM->>SM: Plan Process Improvements

  alt Release decision
    DEV->>PO: Propose Release
    PO-->>STK: Communicate Release Plan
  else Defer release
    DEV->>SM: Continue with Next Sprint Planning
  end
